title: "Leaderboard, and the two refusals it derives from the graph"
description: "Rank checkpoints on one benchmark version, and refuse - non-zero, not a warning - when asked to rank across environment versions or on a benchmark contaminated by the training environment. Both refusals read the dependency graph, so neither depends on a human remembering."
